    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a practical tool for me rather than an abstract passion. I use it daily in my self-employed work, especially for budgeting and basic calculations. While not my favorite subject, I respect its precision and logic. My vocational training gave me enough competence to handle everyday tasks without anxiety.",
